  "description": "Runs the Shiny.AppDeviceBridge server in a .NET MAUI app: starts it with the app, restarts it on resume when the OS took its socket, and fills in the host version. Adds the device bridge (browser, maps, share, haptics, vibration, keep-awake, clipboard) the sensors bridge and the passkeys bridge (WebAuthn / FIDO2 with Face ID, Touch ID, Android Credential Manager and Windows Hello) over .NET MAUI Essentials. Works on Android, iOS, Mac Catalyst, Windows, and the maui-labs macOS (AppKit) and Linux (GTK4) backends. Add Shiny.AppDeviceBridge.WebView to show a web app.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
